==Dutch==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|dum|nl}} {{term|immer||t=always|lang=dum}}, from {{etyl|odt|nl}} {{term|iomer||t=always|lang=odt}}. From {{compound|ie|meer|t1=always|t2=more}}. Related to {{term|ieder|lang=nl}}, {{term|iemand|lang=nl}}, {{term|iets|lang=nl}}, {{term|ooit|lang=nl}}. Cognate with German {{term|immer|lang=de}}.

===Adverb===
{{nl-adv}}

# {{formal|lang=nl}} [[always]]

